        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Metaplastic papillary lesion is a rare, metaplastic lesion of postpartum women with a benign intraluminal papillary proliferation of atypical cells.</p>\r\n",
