  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63286,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Metaplastic papillary lesion is typically seen in the tubes of postpartum women.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:36:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63287,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Metaplastic papillary lesion is rare (case reports only).</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:36:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63288,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:36:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63289,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>One study using microsatellite analysis showed a low fractional allelic imbalance rate index, indicating minimal chromosomal alterations as seen in serous borderline tumours, suggesting a relationship between the two entities {21979587}. A recent study showed loss of PTEN expression and cytoplasmic WT1 immunoreactivity in a case of metaplastic papillary tumour. No mutations in <em>KRAS</em> or <em>BRAF</em> were found {28668862}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:36:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63290,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:36:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63291,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>It is characterized by a microscopic, intraluminal, papillary proliferation composed of distinctive, columnar cells with abundant eosinophilic cytoplasm, lack of significant nuclear atypia or mitoses, minimal budding, and pseudostratification bearing a resemblance to ovarian serous borderline tumour {24901398}. Oncocytic and mucinous metaplasia may be present.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:36:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63292,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:36:12"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
