        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 186,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> an intratubal luminal papillary proliferation lined by mildly atypical columnar cells with abundant cytoplasm.</p>\r\n",
